- Router: `backend/src/lib/videoDelivery.ts` and `src/lib/videoDelivery.js`
- Frontend player: `src/components/features/Gallery/GalleryVideo.jsx`
- Backend ingest & clipping: `backend/src/lib/stream.ts`
- R2 byte-range server: `backend/src/routes/r2.ts`
- Browser probe: `src/lib/videoProbe.js`
